{"effective_mode":"full","effective_text_preview_length":200,"nodes":[{"end_index":29,"heading_level":1,"paragraph_index":1,"start_index":0,"text_preview":"EAC-RUL：机组自适应条件化 + 现代化骨干 实现规格","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":101,"paragraph_index":2,"start_index":30,"text_preview":"基于 enterzxk/deepseekrul main 分支的冻结协议和 PE 模型 · 供 agent 按序执行 · 2026-11-03","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":110,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":3,"start_index":102,"text_preview":"0. 目的与闸门","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":217,"paragraph_index":4,"start_index":111,"text_preview":"动机： 机组间的初始磨损差异是 C-MAPSS 上的主要干扰。现有「早期健康基准」只做固定偏移。EAC 让网络读取该机组自己的前 k 个周期，端到端学出机组","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":361,"paragraph_index":5,"start_index":218,"text_preview":"闸门 G1（EAC）： FD001+FD002，单模型 3 个种子，验证集 RMSE 上 V1 相对 V0 的 ΔRMSE ≥ 0.3，且配对 bootstrap 的 95% CI 排除 0，同时 V6（打乱早期周期的对照）的","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":415,"paragraph_index":6,"start_index":362,"text_preview":"闸门 G2（骨干）： 现代骨干相对现有骨干在验证集上没有显著更好，就保留现有骨干，把「简单但强」写成优点。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":424,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":7,"start_index":416,"text_preview":"1. 与仓库对齐","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":555,"paragraph_index":8,"start_index":425,"text_preview":"先读（只读，不改）： docs/FINAL_PROTOCOL.md；docs/director/REVIEW_20261022_R3.md 的 §J；paper/E5_CONSISTENCY.md 的 §4；tests/test_audit_fixes.py。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":692,"paragraph_index":9,"start_index":556,"text_preview":"定位 PE 模型： 在仓库里找 PE 线的实现（可能在根目录的 .e3pe.py 或相关脚本，用 grep 查 sinusoidal、sensor attention、健康基准、EMA），以它为 V0，不要从零","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":785,"paragraph_index":10,"start_index":693,"text_preview":"新增： src/eac.py、src/modern_backbone.py、scripts/run_eac.py、tests/test_eac.py，输出到 results/eac/。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":884,"paragraph_index":11,"start_index":786,"text_preview":"不要使用： CRGraphTransformer 与 P9/P10 的 synergy head（_smooth_terminal 顺序 bug，数字作废）；P7 数字（已在 book 层撤回）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":901,"paragraph_index":12,"start_index":885,"text_preview":"冻结协议（不得改动，只增配置）：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":949,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000016","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":13,"start_index":902,"text_preview":"标签 clip125；标准 14 传感器；仅训练集归一化；FD002 沿用现有 scaler。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1057,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000016","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":14,"start_index":950,"text_preview":"FD001：window 50，stride 1，d_model 64，dropout 0.15，weight_decay 1e-4，batch 256，lr 1e-3，80 epochs，patience 20。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1102,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000016","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":15,"start_index":1058,"text_preview":"闸门阶段种子 101、202、303；确认阶段 101、202、303、404、505。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1143,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000016","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":16,"start_index":1103,"text_preview":"官方 test 文件保持封存，解封只能由用户显式授权，agent 不得自行解封。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1153,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":17,"start_index":1144,"text_preview":"2. EAC 结构","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":1234,"paragraph_index":18,"start_index":1154,"text_preview":"输入： 该机组前 k 个周期 E（k×14），默认 k=30。机组长度不足 k 时用全部可用周期并带 mask，先逐子集检查测试机组的最短长度，并在日志里记录。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1333,"paragraph_index":19,"start_index":1235,"text_preview":"防泄漏约束： E 只取该机组周期下标 < k 的观测，测试机组同理；不使用任何 RUL 或总寿命。FD002/FD004 要沿用 V0 里工况校正后的 z 值，因为前 k 个周期未","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1338,"paragraph_index":20,"start_index":1334,"text_preview":"编码器：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1395,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000017","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":21,"start_index":1339,"text_preview":"逐传感器统计：对每个传感器取 E 上的 mean、std、首尾差，经 Linear 映射成 64 维传感器嵌入。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1433,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000017","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":22,"start_index":1396,"text_preview":"机组嵌入 g：对 14 个传感器嵌入取平均，再过 MLP，得到 64 维。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1526,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000017","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":23,"start_index":1434,"text_preview":"FiLM 生成：对每个传感器 s，用 Linear(g 拼接 sensor_id_s) 输出 (γ_s, β_s)，各 64 维；最后一层零初始化，使初始时 γ=1、β=0，网络恒等。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1625,"paragraph_index":24,"start_index":1527,"text_preview":"应用位置： 在共享传感器映射之后、逐传感器时间卷积之前，对每个传感器 token 做 h_s ← γ_s ⊙ h_s + β_s。可选第二处：Transformer 编码器之后再做一次","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1689,"paragraph_index":25,"start_index":1626,"text_preview":"训练增强与正则： 训练时 k 在 [20, 30] 随机；FiLM 参数 L2（1e-4）；机组嵌入 dropout 0.1。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1704,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":26,"start_index":1690,"text_preview":"3. 现代骨干（G2 对象）","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":1812,"paragraph_index":27,"start_index":1705,"text_preview":"Patch 化： 每个传感器序列（50 步×3 特征）切成 patch_len 5、stride 5 的 10 个 token，Linear(15→64)，取代逐步的 3→64 映射。逐传感器深度卷积作为可选消融。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1828,"paragraph_index":28,"start_index":1813,"text_preview":"时间混合器（按验证集选一个）：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1864,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000018","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":29,"start_index":1829,"text_preview":"M1：现有的 1 层 4 头 Transformer 编码器（基线）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1915,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000018","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":30,"start_index":1865,"text_preview":"M2：RoPE + SwiGLU 的 pre-norm Transformer 块，1 到 2 层。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1957,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000018","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":31,"start_index":1916,"text_preview":"M3：Mamba-2 块。环境没有 mamba_ssm 就先跳过，不手写慢速实现。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1980,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000018","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":32,"start_index":1958,"text_preview":"M4：xLSTM，低优先级，时间不够就不做。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2025,"paragraph_index":33,"start_index":1981,"text_preview":"参数量与 V0 相差不超过 5%。传感器注意力融合、c 的 PE、MLP 头沿用 V0。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2033,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":34,"start_index":2026,"text_preview":"4. 变体矩阵","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2052,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":35,"start_index":2034,"text_preview":"V0：现有 PE 模型，冻结，原样。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2076,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":36,"start_index":2053,"text_preview":"V1：V0 + EAC，保留手工健康基准特征。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2102,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":37,"start_index":2077,"text_preview":"V2：V0 + EAC，去掉手工健康基准偏差特征。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2130,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":38,"start_index":2103,"text_preview":"V3：V0 去掉手工健康基准偏差特征（V2 的对照）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2152,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":39,"start_index":2131,"text_preview":"V4：G2 选出的现代骨干，其余同 V0。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2167,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":40,"start_index":2153,"text_preview":"V5：现代骨干 + EAC。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2203,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000019","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":41,"start_index":2168,"text_preview":"V6：对照，把每台机组的 E 换成另一台随机机组的 E，其余同 V1。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2212,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":42,"start_index":2204,"text_preview":"5. 损失与训练","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2305,"paragraph_index":43,"start_index":2213,"text_preview":"沿用冻结协议的 MSE + Asym(1.0)，late weight 2.0；如果 V0 用了 Mono(0.05) 就同样沿用。不引入新损失。EAC 只多一个 FiLM L2 项。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2313,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":44,"start_index":2306,"text_preview":"6. 评估协议","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2379,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":45,"start_index":2314,"text_preview":"子集：先 FD001 与 FD002；确认 dataset.py 对 FD003/FD004 的支持，不支持就先补加载器并加单测。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2407,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":46,"start_index":2380,"text_preview":"验证集选模；官方 test 只在用户授权解封后跑一次。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2472,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":47,"start_index":2408,"text_preview":"指标：RMSE、MAE、NASA Score、late fraction、severe（e > 10，e = 预测 − 真值）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2510,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":48,"start_index":2473,"text_preview":"分层：按训练集总寿命的三分位数分短、中、长三组，报每组 RMSE 与偏差。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2563,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":49,"start_index":2511,"text_preview":"统计：与 V0 做配对发动机聚类 bootstrap（4000 次），报 ΔRMSE 的 95% CI。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2606,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001a","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":50,"start_index":2564,"text_preview":"单模型报 5 个种子的 mean±std；15 模型集成另报，成员只能用验证集选择。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2625,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":51,"start_index":2607,"text_preview":"7. 单元测试（先写，通过后再训练）","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2655,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":52,"start_index":2626,"text_preview":"改变机组周期下标 ≥ k 的数据，EAC 的输出完全不变。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2688,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":53,"start_index":2656,"text_preview":"EAC 初始化时恒等：V1 初始输出与 V0 一致（atol）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2708,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":54,"start_index":2689,"text_preview":"机组长度小于 k 时不报错，输出有限。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2738,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":55,"start_index":2709,"text_preview":"打乱标签，EAC 的输出不变（不依赖 RUL 与总寿命）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2765,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":56,"start_index":2739,"text_preview":"V0 复现已记录的验证集 RMSE（容差 0.3）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2788,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":57,"start_index":2766,"text_preview":"V6 的 E 来自另一台机组，且不是同一台。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2841,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001b","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"decimal","paragraph_index":58,"start_index":2789,"text_preview":"沿用 tests/test_audit_fixes.py 的泄漏与时间索引回归测试，新增代码路径也要过。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2849,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":59,"start_index":2842,"text_preview":"8. 执行阶段","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2903,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001c","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":60,"start_index":2850,"text_preview":"Phase A（G1）： FD001 与 FD002，种子 101、202、303，跑 V0、V1、V6。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2963,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001c","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":61,"start_index":2904,"text_preview":"Phase B： G1 通过后跑 V2、V3；同时做骨干 A/B（V0 对 V4），得出 G2 结论；通过后跑 V5。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3013,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001c","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":62,"start_index":2964,"text_preview":"Phase C： 最佳组合在 FD001 到 FD004、5 个种子上确认；再做 15 成员集成。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3077,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001c","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":63,"start_index":3014,"text_preview":"Phase D（分析）： 机组嵌入的 PCA 或 t-SNE，对照前 k 周期的健康水平与工况着色；γ、β 的分布；分层误差。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3105,"paragraph_index":64,"start_index":3078,"text_preview":"预注册成功标准（跑之前写进文档，结果出来后不得修改）：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3160,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001d","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":65,"start_index":3106,"text_preview":"主：V1 相对 V0 的验证集 ΔRMSE ≥ 0.3，CI 排除 0，且 V6 的增益不到 V1 的一半。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3208,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001d","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":66,"start_index":3161,"text_preview":"次：短寿命组的偏差绝对值不增大；late 与 severe 不恶化；FD002 不劣于 V0。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3227,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001d","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":67,"start_index":3209,"text_preview":"未达到就按负结果如实报告，不调标准。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3236,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":68,"start_index":3228,"text_preview":"9. 输出与诚信","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":3331,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001e","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":69,"start_index":3237,"text_preview":"results/eac/<subset>_<variant>_seed*/metrics.json（含 code_sha256）；test_predictions.csv 仅在解封后生成。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3382,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001e","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":70,"start_index":3332,"text_preview":"汇总脚本只读 metrics.json，不手写任何数字（沿用仓库的 Integrity rule）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3390,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":71,"start_index":3383,"text_preview":"10. 不要做","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":3421,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001f","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":72,"start_index":3391,"text_preview":"不用 test 调参或选模；不自行解封官方 test 文件。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3451,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001f","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":73,"start_index":3422,"text_preview":"不把 P7 到 P10 或已撤回的 est 结果写进论文。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3464,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001f","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":74,"start_index":3452,"text_preview":"不改冻结协议，只增配置。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3476,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001f","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":75,"start_index":3465,"text_preview":"不在结果出来后改判据。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3515,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"00001f","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":76,"start_index":3477,"text_preview":"不把骨干选择（Mamba、RoPE 等）写成贡献点，只作为消融中的骨干选择。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3524,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_index":77,"start_index":3516,"text_preview":"11. 已知风险","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":3562,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000020","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":78,"start_index":3525,"text_preview":"EAC 可能只学到工况或机组编号而不是初始磨损，V6 对照用来识别这一点。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3613,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000020","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":79,"start_index":3563,"text_preview":"k 太小时嵌入噪声大；FD002 与 FD004 的前 k 个周期工况覆盖不全，要用工况校正后的值。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3637,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000020","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":80,"start_index":3614,"text_preview":"小数据上现代骨干不一定赢，G2 就是为此设的。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3711,"is_numbering":true,"num_id":"000020","numbering_level":1,"numbering_type":"bullet","paragraph_index":81,"start_index":3638,"text_preview":"写论文前必须专门查重：hypernetwork、in-context 校准、机组级自适应在 RUL 里是否已有先例；目前没有查过，不能声称无先例。","type":"Paragraph"}],"numbering_list_summaries":[{"num_id":"000016","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":13,"text_preview":"标签 clip125；标准 14 传感器；仅训练集归一化；FD002 沿用现有 scaler。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":14,"text_preview":"FD001：window 50，stride 1，d_model 64，dropout 0.15，weight_decay 1e-4，batch 256，lr 1e-3，80 epochs，patience 20。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":15,"text_preview":"闸门阶段种子 101、202、303；确认阶段 101、202、303、404、505。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":16,"text_preview":"官方 test 文件保持封存，解封只能由用户显式授权，agent 不得自行解封。"}],"numbering_type":"bullet"},{"num_id":"000017","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":21,"text_preview":"逐传感器统计：对每个传感器取 E 上的 mean、std、首尾差，经 Linear 映射成 64 维传感器嵌入。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":22,"text_preview":"机组嵌入 g：对 14 个传感器嵌入取平均，再过 MLP，得到 64 维。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":23,"text_preview":"FiLM 生成：对每个传感器 s，用 Linear(g 拼接 sensor_id_s) 输出 (γ_s, β_s)，各 64 维；最后一层零初始化，使初始时 γ=1、β=0，网络恒等。"}],"numbering_type":"bullet"},{"num_id":"000018","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":29,"text_preview":"M1：现有的 1 层 4 头 Transformer 编码器（基线）。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":30,"text_preview":"M2：RoPE + SwiGLU 的 pre-norm Transformer 块，1 到 2 层。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":31,"text_preview":"M3：Mamba-2 块。环境没有 mamba_ssm 就先跳过，不手写慢速实现。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":32,"text_preview":"M4：xLSTM，低优先级，时间不够就不做。"}],"numbering_type":"bullet"},{"num_id":"000019","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":35,"text_preview":"V0：现有 PE 模型，冻结，原样。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":36,"text_preview":"V1：V0 + EAC，保留手工健康基准特征。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":37,"text_preview":"V2：V0 + EAC，去掉手工健康基准偏差特征。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":38,"text_preview":"V3：V0 去掉手工健康基准偏差特征（V2 的对照）。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":39,"text_preview":"V4：G2 选出的现代骨干，其余同 V0。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":40,"text_preview":"V5：现代骨干 + EAC。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":41,"text_preview":"V6：对照，把每台机组的 E 换成另一台随机机组的 E，其余同 V1。"}],"numbering_type":"bullet"},{"num_id":"00001a","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":45,"text_preview":"子集：先 FD001 与 FD002；确认 dataset.py 对 FD003/FD004 的支持，不支持就先补加载器并加单测。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":46,"text_preview":"验证集选模；官方 test 只在用户授权解封后跑一次。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":47,"text_preview":"指标：RMSE、MAE、NASA Score、late fraction、severe（e > 10，e = 预测 − 真值）。"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":48,"text_previ